  "job_B5.1_20251003_114800": {
    "text": "Her ki\u00f0 hu Saturnus and Saloman fettode ymbe heora wisdom.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Saturnus to Salomane.\nSage me hwer God sete \u00fea he geworhte heofonas and eor\u00f0an.\nIc \u00fee secge, he s\u00e6tt ofer winda fe\u00f0erum.\nSage me hwilc word \u00e6rust for\u00f0eode of Godes mu\u00f0e.\nIc \u00fee secge: fiat lux et facta est lux.\nSaga me for hwilcum \u00f0ingum heofon sy gehaten heofon.\nIc \u00f0e secge, for \u00feon he behela\u00f0 eall \u00fe\u00e6t hym beufan by\u00f0.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t ys God.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ys God \u00fee ealle \u00f0ing on hys gewealdum hafa\u00f0.\nSaga me on hu fala dagum God geworhte ealle gesceafta.\nIc \u00fee secge, on VI d\u00e6gum God gesceop ealle gesceafta.\nOn \u00feam \u00e6rostan d\u00e6ge he gesceop leoht.\nOn \u00feam \u00e6fteran d\u00e6ge he gesceop \u00fea gesceapu \u00f0e \u00feisne heofon healda\u00f0.\nOn \u00feam \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge he gesceop s\u00e6 and eor\u00f0an.\nOn \u00feam feor\u00f0an d\u00e6ge he gesceop heofon\u00e6s tunglon, and on \u00f0am V d\u00e6ge he gesceop fixas and fugelas\nSaga me hwanon w\u00e6s Adames nama gesceapen.\nIc \u00fee secge, fram IIII steorrum.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t hatton \u00feage.\nIc \u00fee secge, Arthox, Dux, Arotholem, Minsymbrie.\nSaga me \u00fe\u00e6t andworc \u00fee Adam w\u00e6s of geworht, se \u00e6rustan man.\nIc \u00f0e secge, of VIII punda gewihte.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t hatton \u00feage.\nIc \u00f0e secge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6roste w\u00e6s foldan pund of \u00f0am him w\u00e6s flesc geworht.\nO\u00f0er w\u00e6s fyres pund; \u00feanon hym w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t blod read and hat.\n\u00d0ridde w\u00e6s windes pund; \u00feanon hym w\u00e6s seo \u00e6\u00f0ung geseald; feor\u00f0e w\u00e6s wolcnes pund; \u00feanon hym\nFifte w\u00e6s gyfe pund; \u00feanon hym w\u00e6s geseald sefa and ge\u00f0ang.\nSyxste w\u00e6s blosmena pund; \u00feanon hym w\u00e6s eagena myssenlicnys geseald.\nSeofo\u00f0o w\u00e6s deawes pund; \u00f0anon him becom swat.\nEahto\u00f0e w\u00e6s sealtes pund; \u00feanon him w\u00e6ron \u00fea tearas sealte.\nSaga me on hwilcere ylde w\u00e6s Adam \u00f0a he geseapen w\u00e6s.\nIc \u00fee secge, he w\u00e6s on XXX wintra yldo.\nSaga me hu lang w\u00e6s Adam on l\u00e6nge geseapen.\nIc \u00f0e secge, he w\u00e6s VI and CX ynca lang.\nSaga me hu fela wintra leofode Adam on \u00feissere worulde.\nIc \u00fee secge, he leofode IX hund wintra and XXX wintra on geswince and on yrm\u00f0e, and sy\u00f0\u00f0an to\nSaga me hu fela wintra h\u00e6fede Adam \u00e6r he bearn strinde.\nIc \u00fee secge, an hund wintra and XXX wintra \u00e6r he bearn strinde; and \u00fea gestrinde he bearn on hys\n\u00d0a lyfde Seth hys sunu an hund wintra and V wintra \u00e6r he bearn gestrinde; and \u00fea gestrinde he b\u00e6arn\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Enos an hund wintra \u00fea gestrinde he Chanan and \u00fea lyfde he Enos ealles nygon hund\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Malaleh V and LX wintra \u00f0a gestrinde he Iared, and Malaleh he lyfde ealles nygon hund\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Iared II and LX wintra and an hund wintra \u00fea gestrinde he Enoh, and Iared hys f\u00e6der\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Enoh V and LX wintra \u00fea gestrinde he Matusalem, and Enoh lyfde ealles CCC wintra\n\u00d0a genam hine God myd sawle and mid lychaman up in \u00feone heofon.\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Mathusalem VII and LXXX wintra and an hund wintra \u00fea gestrinde he Lamec, and\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Lamec an hund wintra and LXXXII wintra \u00fea gestrinde he Noe, and Lamec lyfde ealles\n\u00d0a h\u00e6fede Noe \u00d0 wintra \u00f0a gestrinde he bearn Sem, Cham, Iafet, and Noe lyfde ealles in \u00f0issere\nSaga me hu f\u00e6la \u00feeoda awocon of hys III bearnum.\nIc \u00fee secge, LXXII \u00feeoda sindon; and of Seme hys yldestan suna awocon XXX and of Cham XXX\nSaga me hw\u00e6t w\u00e6s se \u00f0e acenned n\u00e6s and \u00e6ft bebyrged was on hys moder inno\u00f0e, and \u00e6fter \u00feam\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t was Adam.\nSaga me hu lange lyfde Adam on neorxenawange.\nIc \u00fee s\u00e6cge, and on \u00feam he abyrgde \u00fea farbodenan fictrew\u00e6s bl\u00e6da, and \u00fe\u00e6t on frigd\u00e6g and \u00feurh\nSaga me of sancta Maria ylde.\nIc \u00fee secge, heo w\u00e6s III and syxtig geara eald \u00fea heo belyfon w\u00e6s, and heo w\u00e6s XIIII wintra \u00fea heo\nSaga me hu lange worhte men Noes earce.\nIc \u00fee secge, LXXX wintra, of \u00f0am treowcinne \u00fee ys genemned Sem.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t hatte Noes wyf.\nIc \u00fee secge, heo h\u00e6tte Dalila.\nAnd hw\u00e6t hatte Chames wif.\nIaitarecta heo hatte.\nAnd hw\u00e6t hatte Iafe\u00f0es wyf.\nIc \u00fee secge, Catafluuia heo hatte; and o\u00f0rum naman hyg sindon genemnede, Olla and Ollina and\nSaga me hu lange was Noes flod ofer eor\u00f0an.\nIc \u00fee secge, XL daga and nihta.\nSaga me hu lang was Noes earc on lenge.\nIc \u00fee secge, heo was CCC f\u00e6\u00f0ema lang and L f\u00e6\u00f0ema wid and XXX f\u00e6\u00f0ema heah.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t sunu h\u00e6fede Adam.\nIc \u00fee secge, XXX sunena and XXX dohtra.\nSaga me hwilc man atimbrode \u00e6rust c\u00e6astr\u00e6.\nIc \u00f0e secge, Enos hatte and was Niniuem seo burh, and w\u00e6ron \u00fearin gemanna hundtwelftig \u00f0usenda\nAnd hw\u00e6t h\u00e6tte seo burh \u00fe\u00e6r sunne up on morgen g\u00e6\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, Iaiaca hatte seo buruh.\nSaga me hwar g\u00e6\u00f0 seo sunne on \u00e6fen to s\u00e6tle.\nIc \u00fee secge, Garita hatte seo burh.\nSaga me hwilc wyrt ys betst and selust.\nIc \u00fee secge, lilige hatte seo wyrt for \u00feon \u00fee heo getacna\u00f0 Crist.\nSaga me hwilc fugel ys selust.\nIc \u00f0e secge, culfre ys selust; heo getacna\u00f0 \u00feone halegan gast.\nSaga me hwanon cym\u00f0 ligetu.\nIc secge, heo kim\u00f0 fram winde and fram watere.\nSaga me hwilc water ys selust.\nIc \u00fee secge, Iordanem seo ea ys selust for \u00feon \u00f0e Crist was on hyre gefullod.\nSaga me hwader gewiton \u00fea engelas \u00fee Gode wy\u00f0socon on heofona rice.\nIc \u00fee secge, hyg tod\u00e6ldon on \u00feri d\u00e6las; anne d\u00e6l he asette on \u00fe\u00e6s lyftes gedrif; o\u00f0erne d\u00e6l on \u00fe\u00e6s\nSaga me hu fela ys woruld watra.\nIc \u00fee secge, twa syndon sealte s\u00e6 and twa fersce.\nSaga me hwilc man erost w\u00e6re wy\u00f0 hund sprecende.\nIc \u00fee secge, sanctus Petrus.\nSaga me hwilc man a\u00f0ohte \u00e6rust myd sul to \u00e6riende.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Cham, Noes sunu.\nSaga me for hwam stanas ne synt berende.\nIc \u00fee secge, for \u00f0on \u00fee Abeles blod gefeoll ofer stan \u00fea hyne Cham hys bro\u00f0er ofsloh myd annes\nSaga me hw\u00e6t ys betst and wyrst betwinan mannon.\nIc \u00fee secge, word ys betst and wyrst betwix mannon.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t ys cu\u00f0ost mannon on eor\u00f0an to witanne.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t nys n\u00e6nygum men nanwyht swa cu\u00f0 swa he sceal dea\u00f0 \u00ferowian.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t syndon \u00fea III \u00f0ing \u00fee nan man buton lufian ne m\u00e6g.\nIc \u00fee secge, on ys fyr, o\u00f0er is w\u00e6ter, \u00f0ridde ys ysen.\nSaga me hwilc treow ys ealra treowa betst.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ys wintreow.\nSaga me hwar reste\u00f0 \u00feas mannes sawul \u00feone se lychaman slep\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, on \u00ferim stowum heo by\u00f0; on \u00feam bragene, o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00feere heortan, o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00feam blode.\nSaga me for hwan w\u00e6s seo s\u00e6 sealt geworden.\nIc \u00fee secge, of \u00f0am X wordon \u00f0e Moises gesomnode in \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6, Godes bebode, and he awearp\nSaga me hw\u00e6t w\u00e6ron \u00fea wor\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t forme word w\u00e6s, Non habeas Deos alienos, \u00fe\u00e6t ys, Ne lufa \u00feu o\u00f0erne God ofer me;\nSaga me hw\u00e6r ys Moyses byrgen \u00f0\u00e6s kininges.\nIc \u00fee secge, heo ys be \u00feam huse \u00fee Fegor hatte and nan man nys \u00fee hyg wite \u00e6r \u00feam miclan dome.\nSaga me for hwilcum \u00feingum \u00feeos eor\u00f0e awyrge\u00f0 w\u00e6re, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6ft gebletsod.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00feurh Adam heo w\u00e6s awirge\u00f0 and \u00feurh Abeles blod and \u00e6ft heo w\u00e6s gebletsod \u00feurh Noe\nSaga me hwa wingeard erost plantode.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Noe se heahf\u00e6der.\nSaga me hwa nemde \u00e6rost Godes naman.\nIc \u00fee secge, se deoful nemde \u00e6rost Godes naman.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t ys hefogost to berende on eor\u00f0an.\nIc \u00fee secge, mannes synna and hys hlafordes yrre.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t ys \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0rum licyge and o\u00f0rum myslycige.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t is dom.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t syndon \u00fea IIII \u00f0ing \u00f0e n\u00e6fre fulle n\u00e6ron, ne n\u00e6fre ne beo\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, an ys eor\u00f0e, o\u00f0er ys fir, \u00f0ridde ys hell, feor\u00f0e ys se gytsyenda man worulde welena.\nSaga me hu fela ys fleogendra fugelcynna.\nIc \u00fee secge, IIII .l.\nSaga me hu fela ys fisccynna on w\u00e6tere.\nIc \u00f0e secge, VI and XXX.\nSaga me hwilc man \u00e6rost mynster getimbrode.\nIc \u00fee secge, Elias and Eliseus \u00fea witega and, \u00e6fter fulluhte, Paulus and Antonius \u00fea \u00e6rostan ancran.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t syndon \u00fea streamas and \u00fea ean \u00f0e on neorxenawange flowa\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, heora syndon IIII.\nSeo \u00e6roste hatte Fison, seo o\u00f0er hatte Geon, and seo III hatte Tygres, seo feor\u00f0e Eufraten, \u00fe\u00e6t ys\nSaga me for hwan by\u00f0 seo sunne read on \u00e6fen.\nIc \u00fee secge, for \u00f0on heo loca\u00f0 on helle.\nSaga me hwi scyne\u00f0 heo swa reade on morgene.\nIc \u00fee secge, for \u00f0on hyre twyna\u00f0 hw\u00e6\u00f0er heo m\u00e6g \u00fee ne m\u00e6g \u00feisne myddaneard eondscynan swa\nSaga me \u00feas IIII w\u00e6tera \u00fee \u00feas eor\u00f0an feda\u00f0.\nIc \u00fee secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ys snaw and w\u00e6ter and hagol and deaw.\nSaga me hwa \u00e6rost bocstafas sette.\nIc \u00fee secge, Mercurius se gygand.\nSaga me hw\u00e6t bockinna and hu fela syndon.\nIc \u00fee secge, kanones bec syndon ealra twa and hundseofontig; eall swa fela \u00f0eoda syndon on gerime\nMannes bana syndon on gerime ealra CC and XVIII.\nMannes addre \u00fea beo\u00f0 ealra CCC and V and LX.\nMannes to\u00f0a beo\u00f0 on eallum hys lyfe II and XXX.\nOn XII mon\u00f0um beo\u00f0 II and L wucena and CCC dagena and V and LX daga; on XII mon\u00f0um beo\u00f0\nOn XII mon\u00f0um \u00feu sealt syllan \u00feinon \u00f0eowan men VII hund hlafa and XX hlafa buton morgemetten",
